		{
			description: [
				"&4&n&lTHE ARBITER:&r&r&r"
				""
				"Welcome &cprisoner,&r to GregTech: &4Tier Zero&r."
				""
				"You have woken up in the &blobby&r of your local jail. After turning in your"
				"paperwork, you will be able to begin your &csentence.&r "
				""
				"You have been sent to &n&4Tier Zero&r&r. The lowest level possible for a &ccriminal&r like yourself."
				""
				"It seems however, that due to your &bconfession&r and the information on your friends that you gave us, you have a chance at returning home. If you complete &6&lTHE PROJECT&r&r."
				""
				"&7Ha, good luck&r"
